Crawford Reeves is an agent of [[Org/Concordia|Concordia]], one of two Concordia agents sent after [[Phenomena/Keystone|keystone 14]] in [[Geography/Calaria/Hallia/index|Hallia]]. He wears his raiment and the org's yellow, a smiley face on the chest, and his long pinkish hair moves as if in a wind of its own, even indoors. He speaks from a clipboard.

On 3 March he came to the [[Geography/Calaria/Hallia/Sableclutch/Prime Meridian Sub Transit Nexus|Sub Transit Nexus]] with [[Org/Concordia/People/Louis Maller|Louis Maller]] and six Happy Time Enforcers, took the gatehouse outside, and walked into the lobby. He read out that the Party were happiness sinks under Concordia's charter and had five seconds to hand over everything they owned. In the fight he worked a dance that pulled the eye and the feet toward him, and whipped his razor hair at [[People/Benny|Benny]]. [[Org/Prime Meridian/Rapid Connection|Rapid Connection]] burned a gear into his brow, and when he struck at Benny the mark burst and he came apart in rust.

His body was searched after the fight. He carried no weapons and no identification, only a small green stone, opaque and faintly translucent, that proved to be magic and to do nothing at all.
